# Contributing

Keep canonical skills portable and place repository-specific bindings in
overlays. Tests require PowerShell 7.4 or later and Pester 6.2.0 or later. Run
`./tools/Validate-Repository.ps1` and `Invoke-Pester ./tests` before proposing a
change. Do not edit vendored runtime cores without recording whether the change
is upstream, overlay-specific, or a pending divergence.
